      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#pix" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-pix-500 text-black font-bold text-sm hover:bg-pix-400 transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-pix-500/20">
          5% OFF no Pix (Desconto Automático)
        </a>
        <a href="#whatsapp" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/15 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all">
